/S /H2
/P 72 0 R
/T (Visually impaired people often find it difficult to read everyday text, such as books, signboards, and product labels, without help. Existing refreshable Braille devices can be expensive and may not be affordable for everyone. BRAILIO aims to solve this problem using smart glasses with a camera to capture text, OCR to recognize it, and a portable refreshable Braille display to convert it into touch-readable dots, helping users access information more independently.)
/E (Visually impaired people often find it difficult to read everyday text, such as books, signboards, and product labels, without help. Existing refreshable Braille devices can be expensive and may not be affordable for everyone. BRAILIO aims to solve this problem using smart glasses with a camera to capture text, OCR to recognize it, and a portable refreshable Braille display to convert it into touch-readable dots, helping users access information more independently.)
